Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across\Nthe sea Raising our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,voices We take in the beautiful blue world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go Everybody rejoices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sails all unfurled
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah yeah Here we are\Nin between the sea and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the sky Ready now for adventure We're itching\Nto try Get ready to roam So all aboard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,now we're set to go Set sail to the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so deep Ready for a truly grand adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well don't you think that sounds really\Nfun All this excitement is second to none
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across\Nthe sea Raising our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,voices we take In the beautiful blue world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go Everybody rejoices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that I just won't ever\Nforget It's the way that I felt when our
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,journey was set Now I won't be scared As
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,long as I keep that\Nfeeling there With that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.86,0:01:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,let us keep up the pace While\Nenjoying every trip from place to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,place Our timid hearts get the\Nrhythm ingrained So let's keep going,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,adventure awaits So many treasures\Nawait So now let's raise our voices
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in pride Laughing out when they are\Nfound With all the riches in hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,everybody rejoices Party on,\Ncause we stand tall and proud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous. Be aware it's\Ndangerous. Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou, now fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.38,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.08,0:02:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't feel right,\Nleaving Perona behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.02,0:02:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We searched the whole island,\Nwhat else are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just strange. Where the\Nhell did she disappear to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I think we're in the clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.58,0:02:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop the invisibility cloak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.34,0:02:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A perfect escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.18,0:02:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We really cut it close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.90,0:02:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sweating some invisible sweat there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.40,0:03:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd still just like to know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma the Tyrant appeared out\Nof the blue on Thriller Bark.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.02,0:03:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can fill you in on that one. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,apparently Kuma was sent to inform Merde\Nof who'd been chosen to succeed Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.48,0:03:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's a new warlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and he's quite the\Ncontroversial figure!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,His names teach,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but he goes by Blackbeard From what\NI hear, he's a nasty piece of work!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look, Second Division Commander\Nof the Whitebeard Pirates, Firefist Ace,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.66,0:03:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,now awaiting execution\Nat the prison Impel Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace is easily the most famous henchman\NWhitebeard's got working under him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.86,0:03:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A fine gift for teach to\Npresent to the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.69,0:03:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a feeling out\Nthere that this could
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,spell very bad news for\Nour great pirate era.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The tides are turning towards a maelstrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.76,0:03:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There couldn't be a worse time\Nfor Merde to be flat on his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.64,0:03:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see where you're\Ngoing with this, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But I only care about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.62,0:03:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a nice wife. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:04:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Find me a corpse that\Nseems like your type.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want a zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a living woman filled\Nwith blood and passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe everyone passed out in the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,courtyard and slept through the whole day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.35,0:04:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We did fight for a solid 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.76,0:04:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starving to death, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We need some more cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.64,0:04:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I need more than cheese. I'm a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to have meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.94,0:04:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then help me bring my cooking\Nsupplies over to the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our grateful group of survivors don't\Nwant to budge an inch from that place,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,so we'll just make the meal there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.14,0:04:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't felt the sun on our skin in\Nyears, so we're trying to soak it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.74,0:04:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My men are so relieved,\Nthey're weeping with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.66,0:04:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you have this much energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's weird. Really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you certain that\Nyou've got enough food?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.90,0:04:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We got back all the food\Nthat was stolen from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that, someone stocked\Nour stores with Mortius food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who would do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.40,0:04:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whoever they are,\Nthey've got a kind heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.70,0:05:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,As if the food wasn't enough,\Nthey left you all this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.38,0:05:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys don't even have\Nto hunt for treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It just delivers itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This glass band is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.06,0:05:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, it looks slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm claiming this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.18,0:05:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.32,0:05:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.93,0:05:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That one is just costume jewelry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not what I expected\Nyou to say. But you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not even think\Nof taking a single doubloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It would never even cross our minds\Nto steal from our saviors, Namizo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.81,0:05:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I didn't notice\Nall the gemstones in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.31,0:05:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It just kind of slipped out of my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.44,0:05:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, this is a little strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got this feeling like you\Nand I have met somewhere before
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am but I don't recall\Ntelling you my name
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what are you talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on. The Lola\Nlike a fat big zombie Lola
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt this makes any sense to you,\Nso I'll explain later, but for now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this I want you to have it\Nwhat wait for me. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me give away some of our treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this everything you need me to take?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A storm must be coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks fine to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, now this is bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.52,0:06:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on and give me everything you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never felt so alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.28,0:06:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just happy we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure hope you guys are hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.78,0:06:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.22,0:06:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you ask us to carry that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.42,0:06:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys have already done enough for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:06:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Zoro up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's fast asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.70,0:06:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in the mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your ass up! Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Got everything he asked\Nfor bundled up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.74,0:07:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's great, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How's Zoro doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him in such\Nterrible condition before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.98,0:07:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He was teetering on the edge of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.82,0:07:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Something happened while\Nwe were passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He was injured before, but not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's even stranger that Kuma\Nthe Tyrant would just up and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.84,0:07:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And speaking of strange stuff,\Nwhy is Luffy so energetic?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't get it either,\Nbut it's fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.62,0:07:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then look no further!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.24,0:07:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw the whole thing from start\Nto finish, every damn detail,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.08,0:07:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and we can lay it out like you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.94,0:07:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.85,0:07:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy saved your life, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:07:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.35,0:07:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you were trying to take his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But he knocked you out shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you two see just\Nhurry the hell up and tell
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,me what happened well\Nafter I blacked out I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the first part
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That warlord's power was even\Ncrazier than what you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He laid his paws on Straw Hat and\Nmade this bubble come out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he'd extracted all\Nthe damage done to his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, he did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So he took that big ball\Nof suffering, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.94,0:08:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the tiniest bit of that stuff had the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,swords been screaming like\Nhe was being murdered?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But that didn't stop him from taking on\Nevery ounce of that big ball of pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It moved me to tears man\Nyeah same here i was bawling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that explains why luffy's just fine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And Zoro's damn near\Ncomatose. Reckless moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.74,0:09:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you know, let's go spread\Nthe tale of how brave your friend is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.64,0:09:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.66,0:09:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody's got to hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.14,0:09:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.18,0:09:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're keeping your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.30,0:09:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro didn't do this for Luffy's gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.48,0:09:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.74,0:09:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,how do you think it\Nwould make Luffy feel if
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,he found out Zoro is\Nsuffering from his pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say a word or I'll\Nkick the crap out of you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.06,0:09:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's still alive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.98,0:09:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.28,0:09:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.04,0:09:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.30,0:09:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.70,0:09:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,These Straw Hat guys are so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.32,0:09:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,With a crew like that, their\Ncaptain is one lucky dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you two, where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:10:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you guys say you had\Nsomething you wanted to tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does it mean so much to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.48,0:10:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm gonna tell them so bad! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How we supposed to sit\Non such an amazing story?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.30,0:10:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.10,0:10:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this is the most delicious\Nthing I've ever tasted!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.70,0:10:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been years, entire years\Nsince we've had a proper meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so damn happy to be alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's plenty for everyone,\Nso don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,to indulge in such delicacies again why my\Ntaste buds are leaping they're dancing in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,unrestrained joy oh my but i don't have\Ntaste buds do i just shut up and eat already
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,honestly though i uh excuse\Nme getting to gorge myself on
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.80,0:11:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,such mouth-watering meals two\Ndays in I'm starting to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gained some weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.78,0:11:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.52,0:11:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now shut your damn charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the funny skeleton I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you move without any muscles?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.38,0:11:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares? He's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.64,0:11:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.55,0:11:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Dinner. Come on.\NDinner. Oh, baby. Dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.26,0:11:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shaking for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Super.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.36,0:11:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They haven't even opened up the booth yet,\Nand everyone's already lost their mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as loud as a battlefield in here,\Nand he's sleeping right through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.34,0:11:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's about normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.49,0:11:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Zorro's portion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.48,0:11:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now drink up. Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro loves booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:11:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna make him feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs medicine, not booze!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.36,0:12:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How about meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's like a medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.06,0:12:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.16,0:12:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your concern will just\Nhave to be enough, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're concerned, and that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even notice there\Nwas a piano in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.90,0:12:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you said you were\Na violinist or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.02,0:12:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I am, but I can play just\Nabout any instrument.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.80,0:12:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.22,0:12:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, you mind talking about\Nwhat happened out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You had another witness,\Nand I saw the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.68,0:12:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I was quite touched by the two of you. By
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.60,0:12:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,your bravery and your\Ncompassion friendship is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.26,0:12:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,a beautiful thing you shouldn't put me in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,the same boat with zoro\Ni just end up looking
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.66,0:12:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,stupid in comparison\Nno you had just as much
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.64,0:12:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,resolve as he did there\Na song you'd like to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:13:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,hear anything at all\Ni gladly take requests
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.56,0:13:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,huh anything i can think\Nof well in that case
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.66,0:13:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you said you\Nwere taking requests,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You jerk. I thought that\Nwas Binx's brew. Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.72,0:13:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,it's been ages since I last heard\Nthis song Such a nostalgic feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good pick, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I always loved this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it's a classic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.76,0:14:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pirates used to sing\Nit back in the good old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.68,0:14:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It was sung in times of sorrow and joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.82,0:14:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna join my crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.40,0:14:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We could use a musician, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You got your shadow back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can sail anywhere\Nwith us now, day or night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.28,0:14:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that easy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I'd like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.22,0:14:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something important\NI haven't told you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.62,0:14:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.44,0:14:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to keep my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise to a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.56,0:14:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still my life's goal\Nto fulfill that promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I don't, I wouldn't have\Nthe right to call myself a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.54,0:14:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're talking about Laboon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.10,0:14:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.12,0:15:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky and the guys told me\Nthe whole story. Is that so I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.44,0:15:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,don't know how much they told\Nyou exactly but he's a whale
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you see there's a cape that's\Nwhat I'm trying to say we've
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,been to the twin caves and\Nwe've met Laboon it's the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear it and I can tell you\Nthis for a fact too the boon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.68,0:15:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,has been right there for 50\Nyears waiting for his friends to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,return.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.65,0:15:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, something wrong, Skeleton?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.84,0:15:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's the tempo slowing down?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can imagine how surprised I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.06,0:15:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty crazy you turned out to be\None of the That frenzy's been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of feels like fate, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And that promise you made, he still\Nremembers it just as clear as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.12,0:16:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Laboon's gonna be so happy\Nwhen he finds out you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.38,0:16:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just give me a moment here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.66,0:16:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.57,0:16:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.72,0:16:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So what you're saying is you\Nguys met Laboon? You truly did?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.46,0:16:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, even after 50 years all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Laboon's still waiting at\Nthe Cape for me to come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.56,0:16:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,just as we left him, you're not joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.50,0:16:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.10,0:16:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We can back him up on that, your\Nbig buddy's there, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, and he's doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.54,0:16:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.82,0:16:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's as big as a damn mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.74,0:16:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.84,0:16:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The last time I saw him, he\Nwas the size of a small boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.62,0:16:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He was so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He could be difficult at\Ntimes, but oh, he loved music.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.76,0:17:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He was such a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.42,0:17:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even now, I remember\Nexactly what he looked like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can picture him when we said goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.36,0:17:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after all this time,\Nhe's still doing okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.04,0:17:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been this\Nhappy in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.20,0:17:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with this little whale?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't stop following our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably got separated\Nfrom his family. Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.60,0:17:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost in this big ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.44,0:17:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You look so sad little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:17:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a baby, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey captain Yorkie, how about we\Ncheer up the little guy with a song?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a brilliant idea, Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.50,0:18:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right everybody grab your instrument
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.22,0:18:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The rumbar pirates can bring a\Nsmile to the face of any creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's show them how we do it boys
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine, my fellow pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.80,0:18:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The day is upon us, and it is gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:19:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll start this day with a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let me see what shall\Nbe this week's power tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, the Black\NHandkerchief of Happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.18,0:19:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid to sing along, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.74,0:19:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a white handkerchief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful now, he's on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away, precious white.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.30,0:19:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Handkerchief, you cannot escape your bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It is far too late,\Nthe octopus won't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.02,0:19:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out, Brooke, it's\Ntoo damn early for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We're awake, we're\Nawake, just please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercy man, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.46,0:19:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away, find the right\Nhandkerchief of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.24,0:19:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brook, think you could do a\Nballad version of Binks's brew?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.22,0:19:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Captain's Choice coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.88,0:20:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the whale, the\Nsame one from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.64,0:20:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.24,0:20:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.30,0:20:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking for your pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.48,0:20:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how long do you think\Nhe's gonna follow us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.35,0:20:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,His poor mom's got to\Nbe worried about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have some food, Laboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.04,0:20:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Laboon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.08,0:20:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when did you give\Nthe big boy a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.86,0:20:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.12,0:20:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you two all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.70,0:20:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to hurry up\Nand help us back on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,His legs hurt pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.60,0:20:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain York, two men overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.58,0:20:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then throw them a raft.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.84,0:20:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're kind of busy saving the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.40,0:21:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's the best I\Ncan do, since I can't swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.90,0:21:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, Laboon, you saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.02,0:21:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're okay, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.86,0:21:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.98,0:21:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, time to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.02,0:21:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the tune?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.86,0:21:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The boon aren't you freezing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.80,0:21:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's protect Laboon! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.18,0:22:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody messes with our\Nbuddy and gets away with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.08,0:22:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a good boy, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.84,0:22:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's really grown quite attached\Nto you, hasn't he, Brook?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.50,0:22:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.30,0:22:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because he loves music so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.68,0:22:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I betcha it's just cause your\Nhead is the same shape as his.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.16,0:22:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So, do you think you can do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.54,0:22:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We've all tried talking to\Nhim, but it's just no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.70,0:22:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he won't listen to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.18,0:22:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.12,0:23:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's simply no way that we can keep on
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,protecting him like\Nthis where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.08,0:23:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact is, he's still a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.48,0:23:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't take him with\Nus to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.84,0:23:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to listen to me, Laboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.70,0:23:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait, we'll sing later, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.88,0:23:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We really need to talk first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.40,0:23:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's no denying that you and I\Nare friends, but you are still a whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.82,0:23:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The Couran line is too dangerous\Nfor a young child like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be different\Nif you were fully grown,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.14,0:23:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but there are enormous beasts in that sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.18,0:23:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,more savage than any in the West Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.90,0:23:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Baboon, please believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.66,0:23:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried, but he refuses to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.18,0:24:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should just sing then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.86,0:24:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the song I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.02,0:24:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That might make it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.30,0:24:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.14,0:24:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.68,0:24:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but we have to ignore him no matter what,\Nso don't look back until he swims away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.78,0:24:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, we're doing\Nthis for his own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.88,0:24:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This wind's gonna capsize us! What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.28,0:24:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.19,0:24:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.26,0:24:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, men?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.36,0:24:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.72,0:25:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the entrance to the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.60,0:25:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we really made it at long last.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.18,0:25:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.48,0:25:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think anyone's got\Nsight of him for a week now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.08,0:25:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it was a cruel thing to\Ndo, but it was for his own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.64,0:25:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope that he's able to\Nreunite with his family someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.68,0:25:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.94,0:25:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone ready to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.60,0:25:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am I!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.96,0:25:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We are more ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.96,0:25:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.30,0:25:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Onward to conquer the\Nworld's greatest sea! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.98,0:25:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the lighthouse keeper here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.82,0:25:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Crocus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.84,0:25:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you guys got\Nover reverse mountain alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.64,0:25:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the pirates graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.68,0:25:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, give us a break, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.12,0:25:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not dead yet, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.28,0:25:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Calico Yorkie, captain\Nof the Rumbar Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.24,0:25:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You might have heard of our\Nexploits in the West Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.38,0:26:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We earned ourselves quite the\Nreputation around those parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.28,0:26:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to drop in on you like this,\Nbut our ship took a hell of a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.52,0:26:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You can drop anchor here\Nas long as you need,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.56,0:26:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but you gotta pay me for the\Nspace with food and booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.56,0:26:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.88,0:26:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You extort from pirates, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.44,0:26:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.44,0:26:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you should celebrate with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.80,0:26:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,because we're going to have one hell\Nof a party tonight, aren't we, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.10,0:26:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So is that way that followed you guys\Ndown some kind of pet or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.46,0:26:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.26,0:26:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.86,0:26:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How did... Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.84,0:26:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Brook, I live!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.78,0:26:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Brooke, I think it's\Nabout time to play the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.06,0:26:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You really like that song, huh, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.34,0:26:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.44,0:26:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Pirate's Anthem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.80,0:26:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the bone, you like\Nit too, don't you, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.58,0:27:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather up along the\Ncrew. Inside your ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.68,0:27:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Our faces seen and hoops\Nto where, who knows,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.02,0:27:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the waves will be our guide Or across\Nthe ocean's hide Praise the sunshine,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.60,0:27:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor and white. Mercy's\Nout to you. Hey, Brook,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.98,0:27:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,have any requests You would like to hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.78,0:27:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You really can play anything, Hatch and\NBroke All right, pirates, sing it loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.88,0:28:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you can understand, but\Nyou can't follow us this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.24,0:28:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line is too treacherous for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.76,0:28:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you stay put and wait\Nfor us here for a while, Laboon?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.64,0:28:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Our plan is to sail our ship\Nstraight across this sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.78,0:28:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we've sailed through the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.90,0:28:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,our ship will have made a\Ncircle around the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.86,0:28:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means we'll be crossing the\NRed Line again, just like we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.92,0:28:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll come back to this\Ncape as fast as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.68,0:28:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.24,0:28:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll only be maybe two\Nor three years tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.54,0:28:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can wait that long,\Nyou'll see all of us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.34,0:28:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the time we make it back here,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.38,0:28:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have grown big and strong\Nenough to travel along with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.18,0:28:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later, Laboon!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.98,0:28:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You take care of yourself, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.74,0:28:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Laboon!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.78,0:28:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be the last time we say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.42,0:28:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise we're coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.48,0:28:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.52,0:28:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing will ever change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.24,0:28:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Laboon!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.74,0:28:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go swimming off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.78,0:29:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we travel the world,\Nwe're coming right back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.14,0:29:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.56,0:29:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brooke, you're really amazing\Nwith that sword. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.00,0:29:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you can teach me a few tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.24,0:29:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? A tornado?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.06,0:30:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.97,0:30:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It was sunny a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.14,0:30:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.42,0:30:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The place was cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.50,0:30:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been trying to tell you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.00,0:30:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.68,0:30:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,These seas are a complete nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.60,0:30:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.32,0:30:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I Always say\Nbitter seas make for sweet boos.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.66,0:30:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,At the end of the day, Brooke\Nyou want to play a number for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.94,0:30:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't beat good tunes and beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.74,0:30:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.78,0:30:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I was starting to think you'd never ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.68,0:30:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.96,0:30:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.56,0:30:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep forgetting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.80,0:30:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a skeleton now Ow,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.68,0:31:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, stop it. Let me down.\NWhy are you punishing me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.40,0:31:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I don't want you two\Nfighting over every little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.54,0:31:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not some little thing, this lunatic\Nalmost hit me with a stray bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.22,0:31:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.13,0:31:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well you didn't, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.26,0:31:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and he said he was sorry, what's done is\Ndone, no point in going on about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.26,0:31:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt, good, it proves you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.58,0:31:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.24,0:31:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the stars, a sea of\Nlights spreading out forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.66,0:31:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Laboon is\Nlooking up at the same stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.50,0:31:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.36,0:31:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, come look, Brooke's\Ngetting emotional out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.34,0:31:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was being sincere, don't make fun of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.18,0:31:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the marines, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.24,0:31:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Same thing we always do, give them hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.70,0:31:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, look at that, Captain, Yorkie's\Nbounty went up again, he's on a roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.96,0:32:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat that, let's celebrate with a song,\NYorkie, Yorkie, a bounty on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.82,0:32:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Out the twin cape flies the\Nnews, the navy wants his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.16,0:32:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad news, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.72,0:32:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong with the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.46,0:32:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He ain't looking so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.84,0:32:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.08,0:32:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A virus?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.50,0:32:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.41,0:32:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone stay out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.58,0:32:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a dozen men infected already.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.76,0:32:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I figure they must have contracted it\Nwhen we passed through that jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.78,0:32:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.82,0:32:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,None of my treatments work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.48,0:33:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We've all got to be careful now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.76,0:33:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If this plague keeps spreading, we\Nwon't have enough men to sail this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.52,0:33:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please hang in there, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.24,0:33:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't sound so depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.52,0:33:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the Rumbar Pirates, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.54,0:33:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We bring smiles to children's faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.28,0:33:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I admit I've seen better days, and\Nthat goes for the rest of the ship, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.50,0:33:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I won't be able to\Ntravel the Grand Line with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.74,0:33:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to part ways here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.76,0:33:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take this ship, but I want all\Nof you to move forward with a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.14,0:33:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.54,0:33:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't risk the infection spreading\Nany more than it already has.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.80,0:33:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll drop you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.82,0:33:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Try passing through the Calm Belt and\Nlook for help for the sick crew members.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.96,0:33:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll all work out somehow, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.10,0:33:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.90,0:33:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Give Laboon my regards.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.08,0:33:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe those tears away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.64,0:34:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up straight. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.12,0:34:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Brook?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.40,0:34:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.96,0:34:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Give them hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.02,0:34:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I will, my captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.08,0:34:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, as long as I live!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.52,0:34:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never forget those words.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.42,0:34:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.38,0:34:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've engraved them in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.76,0:34:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, we'll meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.00,0:34:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.78,0:34:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We may be parting ways now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.06,0:34:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But this isn't the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.44,0:34:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.34,0:34:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Take off that mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.30,0:34:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.82,0:34:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll all sing together again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.54,0:34:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.66,0:35:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.80,0:35:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you send me off
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.04,0:35:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,With my favorite song?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.22,0:35:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather up all of the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.76,0:35:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to ship out Binx's brew.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.52,0:35:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea wind blows to where?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.16,0:35:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows the waves will be our guide?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.94,0:35:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Or across the ocean's tide?
